      "content": "wait... butter? i thought i heard somewhere that's not good for burns because it traps the heat in. if it's still feeling really hot and pulsing, wouldn't adding grease like butter make it worse by keeping the heat inside the skin? wouldn't an ointment or something like vaseline be better to block out the air?",
